              "text": "صدا دادن (sedâ dâdan) — \"to make a noise, to squeak, to rattle\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "در اتاق موقع باز شدن صدا میدهد. Dar-e otâq mowqe'-e bâz shodan sedâ midahad. The room's door squeaks when it opens."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "sedâ 'sound' + dâdan 'to give'. Present stem dah-: sedâ midahad."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "sedâ dâdan is built from sedâ 'sound', which EtymDB takes from Arabic ṣadā 'echo', and dâdan 'to give', which EtymDB traces to the PIE root deh₃- 'to give'."
            }
          ]
        },
